  "body": "Welcome to 52 Penguin Drive, Murrays Bay. Zoned for Rangitoto College, this property offers a perfect blend of space, comfort, and modern living.\r\n\r\nWith 5 spacious bedrooms and 2 well-appointed bathrooms & 3 toilets, this house is designed to accommodate families of all sizes. Set on a generous 679 sqm land area (more or less), the property features a beautifully landscaped backyard, perfect for outdoor gatherings and relaxation.\r\n\r\nThe interior boasts an inviting living room with hardwood flooring and ample natural light, creating a warm and welcoming atmosphere. The modern kitchen makes meal preparation a delight. The dining room & living room is perfect for family dinners & entertaining, while the lounge is directly attached beside, perfect for late night movies.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include a dedicated office space, ideal for remote work or study, and a double garage for secure parking. Enjoy a sunny day by the swimming pool or host barbecues on the balcony overlooking your private oasis.\r\n\r\nThe home combines functionality with elegance, ensuring a comfortable lifestyle.\r\n\r\nProperty Features:\r\n* Elevated outlook with wide-ranging views, including sea views\r\n* Family sized swimming pool\r\n* 5 bedrooms + 1 Study\r\n* 2 bathrooms + 3 Toilets\r\n* Approx. 300 m2 floor area & approx. 679 m2 land area\r\n* Driveway access to double garage, plus a separate pedestrian entry gate\r\n\r\nLocated in the sought-after Murrays Bay area, this property is close to local amenities, schools, and beautiful beaches. Zoned for Rangitoto, Murrays Bay Primary and Intermediate School.\r\n\r\nThis property is offering you the opportunity to make this exceptional house your new home. Don't miss out on this incredible opportunity. Schedule a viewing today and experience all that 52 Penguin Drive has to offer!",
